  m_Name: Desert_ExpertAdvice_1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Game.Collectable.CollectableItem
  id: Desert_ExpertAdvice_1
  headerName: "Expert Field Notes \u2014 Surviving a Sandstorm"
  content: "Should you face a <color=#cc6600><b>sandstorm</b></color>, expect near-zero
    visibility and violent, howling winds.\n\n<size=120%><b>1. Survival</b></size>\n\n*
    <color=#cc6600><b>Find shelter:</b></color> A building, any structure \u2014
    as quickly as possible.\n* <color=#cc6600><b>Run away:</b></color> If you see
    it from a distance, run. Put as much ground between you and it as you can.\n*
    <color=#cc6600><b>Tying yourself to a tree (not recommended):</b></color> You
    won't be swept away, but you'll be struck by debris and you'll struggle to breathe.
    A slower death. Last resort only.\n\n<size=120%><b>3. Warning Signs</b></size>\n\n*
    <color=#cc6600><b>A thick wall of dust:</b></color> A dense brown or orange wall
    forming at the horizon, moving toward you.\n* <color=#cc6600><b>The sky changes
    color:</b></color> The sky turning yellow or a heavy, unnatural orange \u2014
    even when it isn't sunset.\n* <color=#cc6600><b>Sudden gusts of wind:</b></color>
    Sudden gusts shifting direction and growing stronger."
  type: 0
  biome: 1
  icon: {fileID: 0}
  dialogData: {fileID: 0}
